@startuml UC12_LevelUp_UseCase
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Level Up & Evolution System" {
  (Pokemon gains experience)
  (Check EXP threshold)
  (Enough EXP to level up?)
  (Level up Pokemon)
  (Increase stats)
  (Learn new moves?)
  (Add new move)
  (Check evolution condition)
  (Can evolve?)
  (Trigger evolution)
  (Update Pokedex)
  (Evolution complete)
  (Display level up screen)
}

Player --> (Pokemon gains experience)
(Pokemon gains experience) --> (Check EXP threshold)
(Check EXP threshold) --> (Enough EXP to level up?)
(Enough EXP to level up?) --> (Level up Pokemon)
(Level up Pokemon) --> (Increase stats)
(Increase stats) --> (Learn new moves?)
(Learn new moves?) --> (Add new move)
(Add new move) --> (Check evolution condition)
(Check evolution condition) --> (Can evolve?)
(Can evolve?) --> (Trigger evolution)
(Trigger evolution) --> (Update Pokedex)
(Update Pokedex) --> (Evolution complete)
(Evolution complete) --> (Display level up screen)
(Display level up screen) --> Player

@enduml
